OpenSwoole with OpenSSL: the module openswoole of php82-openswoole built
with the OpenSSL of the base system (its SSL and TLS: SWOOLE_SSL, HTTPS,
WSS), with php82-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php82-mysqlnd; its ini comes
with its line commented out, as that of php82-openswoole. The same files
as php82-openswoole: install one of the two.

PECL openswoole for php82 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/openswoole
of the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20220829/openswoole.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d.
